### Common workflows

| Task | Command |
|---|---|
| Plan a feature, no code | `/svc:plan-feature <description>` |
| Build a feature end-to-end | `/svc:build-feature <description>` |
| Small change | `/svc:quick-task <description>` |
| Fix a bug | `/svc:fix-bug <description or error>` |
